fix comment typo, per Usama.  Reflow comment to 80 cols

Cc: Qi Zheng <zhengqi.arch@bytedance.com>
Cc: Usama Arif <usama.arif@linux.dev>
Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
